Lite Recommender v2

This release is an independent implementation developed from the user's
requirements and evaluation of a user-provided earlier HEA literature
recommendation project. The earlier project supplied workflow ideas and
compatibility context. Its source code, private feedback, cached papers,
credentials and personal research profiles are not included in this release.

The v2 application source is distributed under the MIT License in LICENSE.
Metadata retrieved during use remains subject to each upstream service's
terms. Article full texts retain their respective copyright and access terms.
The application does not grant additional rights to redistribute those files.

Example research questions and synthetic demonstration papers are examples;
they are not findings from a literature search or verified research gaps.
